  "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
  "rate": "-5%"
 },
 {
  "text": "可以再多說一點嗎？",
  "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
  "rate": "-5%"
 },
 {
  "text": "差一點點喔，沒關係，再試一次！",
  "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
  "rate": "-5%"
 },
 {
